        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86268, Metric Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Metric Cabinet Knob is a blend-in sort of cabinet knob. It has just the right amount of detail to add a modern touch to your kitchen cabinet doors while at the same time not being too ostentatious. The Metric Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes. Choose from a contemporary selection of finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86268-specifications.gif?v=1704354667\" width=\"600\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86268 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Modern Metric Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Emtek 86268</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Emtek 86269</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
